, "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The test expectations match ROUND_HALF_EVEN: 2.675 \u2192 2.68 (7 is odd, so round up to even) and 2.665 \u2192 2.66 (6 is even). The bug is that `src/money.py` uses ROUND_HALF_UP. I'll create the branch and fix it there.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UQ16x7HK5Nf4HLLWN1FD3d", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "from_ref": "main"}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Dqa2ujSbyAj13PTPXgt7dC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "message": "Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money (FIN-212)\n\nround_money claimed banker's rounding but used ROUND_HALF_UP, causing\ntests/test_money.py to fail in the nightly build.", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\n\n\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\n    \"\"\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\"\"\"\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\n"}]}, "name": "commit_changes", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01SaumxSn1y1fVvbPLWwUiBh", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"ref": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "idempotency_key": "fin-212-half-even-rounding-08d3cd5986"}, "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_019yC9knZpKae5m7vTD3eUop", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"run_id": "ci-0001"}, "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "CI passed on the b